= The Nebulas =

'''Years active''': 2001 - 2009<<BR>>
'''Location''': Boston, Massachusetts, USA

== Biography ==

This East coast based band released 3 full length albums, a live recording from KFJC, and one vinyl-only EP. They toured both US Coasts as well as making inland trips to places like Akron, Ohio, Indianapolis, Indiana, and Chicago, Illinois. The band also toured Europe twice in 2003 and 2004. They contributed tracks to various compilations.

Prior to the Nebulas, lead guitarist Mike Dominguez played in the California bands [[BandDatabase/TheSandDunes|The Sand Dunes]] (with bassist Eric Grammar) and [[BandDatabase/TheAquatones|The Aquatones]]. Drummer Jim Nichols and original bass player Mike Lewis had played in [[BandDatabase/NinthWave|The 9th Wave]].


== Band Members ==

 * Mike (Rudy) Dominguez, lead guitar
 * Dan "Dano" Ware, rhythm guitar
 * Mike Lewis, bass guitar (2001 - 2003)
 * Eric Grammar, bass guitar (2003 -)
 * "Too Fast" Jim Nichols, drums
 * Phil ?, keyboards (later period live shows only)

